        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana POM40, Small Modern Pommel Cabinet Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Small Pommel Cabinet Pull is a wonderful way to add a modern touch to your kitchen cabinets. This Modern 4 Inch Square Bar Pull comes packaged with the necessary mounting hardware. It is available in a wide array of contemporary finishes. The Small Modern Pommel Cabinet Door Pull has 4 inch mounting centers and is 6 inches in overall length. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-POM40-specifications.gif?v=1704354606\" width=\"588\" height=\"189\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana POM40 Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: \r\n<a href=\"/products/large-pommel-cabinet-pull-deltana-pom70\"><b>Deltana POM70 Large Pommel Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Modern 4 Inch Pommel Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length: 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Bar Thickness: 7/16\" square</li>\r\n<li>Mount Diameter: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Can be installed either vertically or horizontally.</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with installation hardware.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-POM40-specifications.pdf?v=1704262368\"><b>Deltana POM40 Dimensional Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"cetner\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-POM40-installed.jpg?v=1704354606\" width=\"593\" height=\"261 border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana POM40 Installed\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
