                "description": "The Small Pommel Cabinet Pull is a wonderful way to add a modern touch to your kitchen cabinets. This Modern 4 Inch Square Bar Pull comes packaged with the necessary mounting hardware. It is available in a wide array of contemporary finishes. The Small Modern Pommel Cabinet Door Pull has 4 inch mounting centers and is 6 inches in overall length.",
